    "body": "Also, if we go down that route I think it would be better if we put this inside the `<dl>` or directly after the normative `supports()` algorithm. It also needs to use `class=example`. Either on the `<pre>` or if that is preceded by a paragraph, through a surrounding `<div>`.\n",
