    "created_at": "2016-01-22T14:03:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-22T14:03:47Z",
    "body": "The example would indeed basically amount to, \"this is how you use this method\". Those can be useful to developers, since standards use IDL which is not quite what they are used to. I'm happy to leave it out though if you don't think it's of much value.\n",
